ion><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>北京理工大学数学与统计学院拟于2025年7月份举办2025年“数学与统计”暑期夏令营。夏令营期间，将通过举行学术论坛、学科讲座、学长介绍、风采展示、师生交流等在内的系列活动，增进国内高校优秀本科生对北京理工大学数学、统计学、智能科学与技术等学科的了解和认识，感受北京理工大学的学术氛围，为优秀应届本科毕业生搭建交流与研讨的平台。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>申请条件</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.  暑期夏令营主要面向来自全国高校学习成绩优秀、综合表现优异的2026届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.  拥护中国共产党的领导，愿投身于中国特色社会主义现代化建设，服务国家重大战略需求。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.  品德良好，遵纪守法，学习期间未受过任何处分；身心健康，勤奋好学，思维敏捷，具有较强的科研创新能力和学术实践能力。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.  本科期间在核心期刊及以上学术刊物发表论文、授权国家发明专利、获科研成果奖、在国内外高水平科技竞赛中获奖者优先。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>报名流程</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1.  2025 年 7 月 11 日——2025 年 7 月 18 日，通过下面的链接在线报名，并上传相关材料电子版本：</span></span></span><span><span><span>https://yz.bit.edu.cn/yzbm/logon。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.  提交材料顺序如下： </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（1）有效期内身份证（正反面在一页）。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（2）有效期内学生证（个人信息页+注册盖章页）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（3）所在学校教务处盖章的成绩单及成绩排名证明原件。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（4）国家英语四（六）级考试成绩单复印件。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（5）推荐信A:副教授职称及以上专家推荐信。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（6）推荐信B:北京理工大学数学与统计学院教师出具的推荐信（非必须）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（7）其他获奖证书复印件及其他科研成果证明材料。</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>注：以上材料电子版本请按照上述顺序整理为一个 PDF 文档上传系统。请同时将该 PDF 文档发送至 3805315@qq.com，邮件主题“本科院校+姓名+所学专业+报考专业”。</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>3.  数学与统计学院将于 2025 年 7 月 24 日前在学院网站上公布审核录取结果。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>活动安排</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>       1.  活动方式：本次夏令营拟以线上方式举行。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>       2.  活动安排：具体见正式日程手册。</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span><span>（相关活动若因特殊情况变动，以最终通知为准）</span></span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>